==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~40 seconds<sup>60f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Kerihime (form 2)]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 2~30 seconds<sup>60f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 258 seconds<sup>7,740f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ms. Sign]] spawns after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though this stage seems menacing at first glance, it is not a big deal. You can try and lure Kerihime to your side of the base and then spawn your fast/tanky units to quickly dispatch of her, as she only has 24K health. Do be aware that you are timed in this stage, so you can't take too long otherwise Assassin Bears will be spawned.

